#NEXUS

[ ksepka2010a_fig4: Sauropod strict consensus. Eight clade names are kept as internal labels: Neosauropoda, Diplodocoidea, Titanosauriformes, Titanosauria and Lithostrotia at open node circles, and Macronaria, Brachiosauridae and Somphospondyli at arcs on the stems of their nodes. Polytomies: Cetiosaurus, Ferganasaurus and the rest; Suuwassea, the Tornieria clade and Apatosaurus; five brachiosaurids; Bor Guvé Titanosaur, Sonidosaurus and Lithostrotia; Gondwanatitan, Alamosaurus, Opisthocoelicaudia and the saltasaurine pair. 43 tips, 5 polytomies (3, 3, 5, 3, 4 children); 8 printed clade names kept as internal node labels. Sample 5 case (census 2, seed 20261215). Topology transcribed from the figure image and checked node by node; topology only. ]

